CI correction: keep native browser contracts out of Linux builds

Reason:
The browser domain reorganization registered browser_contract_tests on every test target even though browser_events is intentionally native_browser-only. BrowserRuntimeUpdateResult also remained unconditional although its sole implementation module is available only for tests or browser_native_api. Linux strict Clippy therefore failed with one unresolved import and one dead-code error.

Change:
- register browser_contract_tests only when native_browser is linked
- compile BrowserRuntimeUpdateResult only for tests or browser_native_api
- extend the existing build-policy test to lock both boundaries

